Package: com.kolby.swiftpeek
Name: SwiftPeek
Depends: mobilesubstrate, preferenceloader
Version: 0.6.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Read-only SwiftUI + window-tree inspector. 0.6.0 lets you point it at any app: a custom target list in Settings takes bundle IDs or process names, so the tool is no longer limited to the seven Apple apps that were hardcoded in the injection filter. Dumps now record which rule admitted the process, so a missing dump is diagnosable. 0.5.5 fixed the SwiftUI host matcher, which missed UIHostingContentView. No hooks, no FOVO, every target defaults off. Debug tooling; not published.
Maintainer: ma6x9x
Author: ma6x9x
Section: Tweaks

